KodaX Windows Sandbox v2
Copyright 2026 KodaX contributors

The process protocol, explicit stdio, restricted-token, and creation-time Job
design were informed by OpenAI Codex's Apache-2.0 Windows sandbox sources.
This component is an independent KodaX implementation and contains KodaX
modifications for ASRT account/WFP interoperability, immutable policy SIDs,
execution-scoped deny identities, bounded framing, and fail-closed peer loss.
